#: kde-menu.cpp:92
#, qt-format
msgid "Menu item '%1' could not be highlighted."
msgstr "Element menu '%1' nie mòże bëc pòdsztrichniãti."

#: kde-menu.cpp:104
msgid ""
"KDE Menu query tool.\n"
"This tool can be used to find in which menu a specific application is "
"shown.\n"
"The --highlight option can be used to visually indicate to the user where\n"
"in the KDE menu a specific application is located."
msgstr ""
"Nôrzãdze zapëtaniów KDE Menu.\n"
"To nôrzãdze mòże bëc brëkòwóné do nalezeniô w jaczim menu je aplikacëjô.\n"
"Òptacëjô --highlight mòże bëc ùżëtô do pòdsztrichniãcô dlô brëkòwnika dze\n"
"je môl apartny aplikacëji."

